# GO-2026-5932: golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is unmaintained by design and
# will never get a fixed version. Nothing in this module's build graph
# imports the openpgp subpackage ("go mod why golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp"
# answers "main module does not need package"); x/crypto itself rides at the
# latest release only as a transitive module requirement. Suppressed rather
# than chased because no upgrade can clear a no-fix advisory on an unused
# subpackage.
GO-2026-5932
